  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tBookkeeping\n\t\tBookkeeping FAQs\n\n### How to add bank details to the invoices\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 26 Mar, 2024 at  1:54 PM\n\n\t\t1. Select the Doc invoice template.\n\nFor adding the bank details to the invoices.\n\nNavigation: Bookkeeping >> Client specific >> Settings >> Company Info >> Settings (tab) >> Tick Use Doc (word) Invoice Template >> Save.\n\n2. Add or edit template files.\n\nOnce the doc invoice template is selected.\n\nNavigation: Settings >> General Settings >> Invoice Templates >> Add template (if you want to add a new template) or Edit template (for editing the existing one) >> Select the bank from the dropdown >> Save.\n\n(Adding a new template)\n\n(Editing the existing template)\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115344\">Bookkeeping</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188520\">Bookkeeping FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to add bank details to the invoices\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Tue, 26 Mar, 2024 at  1:54 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">1. Select the Doc invoice template.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">For adding the bank details to the invoices.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Navigation: Bookkeeping &gt;&gt; Client specific &gt;&gt; Settings &gt;&gt; Company Info &gt;&gt; Settings (tab) &gt;&gt; Tick Use Doc (word) Invoice Template &gt;&gt; Save.</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:674px;height:301px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9208436355/original/wRVng20pKfkP1kCTf0hZvWWhl3ZWq35lSw.png?1711457323\" width=\"674\" height=\"301\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9208436355\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">2. Add or edit template files.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Once the doc invoice template is selected.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Navigation: Settings &gt;&gt; General Settings &gt;&gt; Invoice Templates &gt;&gt; Add template (if you want to add a new template) or Edit template (for editing the existing one) &gt;&gt; Select the bank from the dropdown &gt;&gt; Save.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:676px;height:300px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpde